how to be more convincing  so i got a great question from our  youtube viewers love you guys  qui stock network i hope i pronounced  that okay  think you could do a video on how to be  more convincing if you already have let  me know  so how to be more convincing the thing  with being convincing it's not going to  come from how much  data you throw at somebody it's not  going to come from  all the proof and all the stats it comes  from your confidence  you have to be confident if you are  confident  in what you're selling people will be  convinced they'll believe you  if you hesitate if you're not sure then  you start to raise doubts  and that's the difference so how do you  become confident in what you're selling  it starts with believing in what you're  doing right believe  you have to believe in what you're doing  if you don't really believe in the  product you're selling  you're not going to be that confident  and you're not going to be that  convincing right  you have to know that it works you know  that it works for you  and you know that has worked for other  people you have to really be confident  and believe that your solution is going  to help this person  when you're talking to somebody and you  see that they have a real problem  remember  business is all about value right you're  giving value you're making money  because you're offering real value to  your customers you're helping them solve  an important problem in their life  whatever it is you have to know  and really feel deep down that what  you're selling  is going to solve their problem and make  them feel happy  if you're not entirely confident about  that  you're not going to be convincing if you  don't even believe it yourself  you don't really feel it yourself how  can you convince somebody else to feel  it  doesn't make sense so that starts with  you believing it  the second part is going to just be  practice  practice getting used to how you say  things getting used to the types of  questions that come back and being able  to handle it  thinking about your own personal stories  that you can share  practice but the main part is really  believe in what you're doing  so let me give you an example i have a  series of mastermind groups  these are groups that i run here in  toronto and we meet once a month we help  each other with our businesses our  entrepreneurs come together  and we try to help each other out when i  was first  talking to people about the groups when  i was first running the groups i would  always be in a suit  you know i would always wear a suit i  always felt like you know i have to be  the professional one i've got to wear  the suit  and i wasn't as confident in the idea so  i felt like  i guess the suit made me feel a little  bit more confident professional  and over the years as i saw how the  groups worked  and i know that the groups work because  i see great results we've seen  businesses go from  just an idea on paper to now being you  know million dollar plus  companies and they credit their success  to the mastermind group so i know it  works  and i know that i'm doing it for the  right reason and i look at entrepreneurs  who come and meet me and i can tell if  they're gonna benefit or not  i can tell if they're gonna if this will  solve their problem or not  so i have the confidence and now when i  go i might be wearing my belief shirt  i might be in the hoodie with jeans on  like i don't need  the dress up to feel confident because i  know  that it works and i have to practice  the discussion i know every question  they're going to ask i have every story  ready to go because i have the  experience and practice but  more importantly i have the confidence  to know  if i can help them or not and if i can't  i tell them like you know what  this group isn't for you either they're  too small  or they're too big or the personality is  not the right fit  or i just don't think it's going to work  and i'll tell them  and that's okay too so remember  business is about value you have to help  your customers  you have to make them you have to solve  their pain  solve their problem and if you can do  that and you know  you can do that and you're confident  when you're talking to them  then they'll sign up you don't have to  convince them of anything  because they believe too belief for  those of you watching like the video  thumbs up below let me know what you  think please leave a comment ask me a  question underneath to make a video  response  and you can click on my face to  subscribe to the channel see more videos  like this  thank you so much i'll see you soon

